###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Table II's caption swaps the units; the column headers (energy meV/atom, force meV/A) are followed. Results cover all three subsystems and are attached to the Pt-Nafion material.
# - Ablation models trained without parts of the data (Table S5) are not encoded as runs. Composition of the common test set is not described in the text read.
# - Densities, RDFs, MSDs (Table S6), proton hopping and reaction-path energies are property results.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/fazel2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

